&quot;&quot;&gt;=0A                                                    1. If your printe=
r connects by a wire=0A                                                &lt;/st=
rong&gt;=0A=0A                                                &lt;p&gt;If your print=
er connects by a wire,=0A                                                  =
  plug it into your device. It&#039;ll connect automatically, your=0A           =
                                         PC will download the right drivers=
, and you can use it right=0A                                              =
      away.&lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A=0A=0A                                                =
&lt;strong&gt;=0A                                                    2. To connec=
t a wireless printer, download the latest=0A                               =
                     driver and software package for your printer model fro=
m=0A                                                    the official websit=
e and follow these steps:=0A                                               =
 &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A=0A                                                &lt;p&gt;a) Se=
lect the Start button, then select Settings &gt;=0A                           =
                         Devices &gt; Printers &amp; scanners &gt; Add a printer or=
=0A                                                    scanner.&lt;/p&gt;=0A     =
                                           &lt;p&gt;b) Wait for it to find nearby=
 printers, then choose the=0A                                              =
      one you want to use, and select Add device. If you want=0A           =
                                         to remove the printer later, just =
highlight it and=0A                                                    sele=
ct Remove.&lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A=0A=0A=0A=0A                                           =
     &lt;h3 class=3D&quot;my-4&quot;&gt;Setup a New Printer (Mac)&lt;/h3&gt;=0A=0A               =
                                 &lt;strong&gt;=0A                               =
                     1.Prepare your printer:=0A                            =
                    &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A                                        =
        &lt;p&gt;Use the instructions that came with your printer to=0A          =
                                          unpack the printer, install ink o=
r toner, and add paper.=0A                                                 =
   Turn on the printer and make sure it=E2=80=99s not displaying=0A        =
                                            any errors.&lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A          =
                                      &lt;strong&gt;=0A                          =
                          2. Connect your printer: Follow the instructions =
that=0A                                                    came with the pr=
inter to connect it to the network.=0A                                     =
           &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A                                                &lt;=
p&gt;=0A                                                    If you have a Wi-F=
i printer, you might need to connect=0A                                    =
                the printer to your Mac with a USB cable to set up Wi-Fi=0A=
                                                    printing. After connect=
ing the printer to your Mac,=0A                                            =
        install the Mac software that came with the printer and=0A         =
                                           use the printer=E2=80=99s setup =
assistant to connect the printer=0A                                        =
            to your Wi-Fi network. After setting up, you can=0A            =
                                        disconnect the cable from your prin=
ter and Mac and the=0A                                                    p=
rinter should remain connected to the Wi-Fi network.=0A                    =
                            &lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A                                     =
           &lt;strong&gt;=0A                                                    3=
. Add the printer to your list of available printers:=0A                   =
                             &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A                               =
                 &lt;p&gt;=0A                                                    =
Choose Apple menu &gt; System Settings, then click Printers=0A                =
                                    &amp; Scanners in the sidebar. (You may nee=
d to scroll=0A                                                    down.)&lt;/p=
&gt;=0A=0A                                                &lt;strong&gt;=0A         =
                                           4. When your printer appears in =
the list, select your=0A                                                   =
 printer, then click Add.=0A                                               =
 &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A=0A                                                &lt;p&gt; It m=
ay take a minute or two for your printer to appear.=0A                     =
